# UI & shadcn

## Prefer existing primitives
- `@/components/ui/*` — Button, Card, Input, Table, Badge, Dialog, DropdownMenu, Tabs, Sheet, Checkbox, Switch
- Forms: `lib/ui/modal` (`FormModal`, `FormField`), `lib/ui/FormSelect`, `lib/ui/MultiSelect`
- Export: `lib/ui/dropdown/ExportDropdown`
- Class merge: `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`
- Tokens: `@/lib/themeTokens` for focus rings / surfaces when matching chrome

## Patterns
- Primary actions: default `Button` (theme primary) — not hardcoded `bg-blue-600`
- Modals: `FormModal` for create/edit; use `showDelete` when editing
- Tables: shadcn `Table` + search `Input` + pagination pattern from sibling modules
- Empty states: short muted copy + one CTA
- Feedback: `toast` from `sonner` on create/update/delete

## Do not
- Add a new design system or replace shadcn with MUI/Chakra
- Build one-off modal shells when `FormModal` fits
- Use `window.alert` / `confirm` for UX flows
